Update vendored crates flagged by RustSec to their newest semver-compatible
releases with `cargo update -p <crate>@<version> --precise <version>`:
  crossbeam-epoch 0.9.18 -> 0.9.21 (RUSTSEC-2026-0204)
  rustix 1.1.4 -> 1.1.6 (RUSTSEC-2026-0486)
cargo also re-resolved the Windows-only windows-sys requirements of
dependents to 0.52.0, which a Linux build never compiles.

